ernal walls.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">ACE / Apex for External Walls.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Oil paint for MS Grill / Railing.</font></li></ul><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><font size=\"5\"><u>ELECTRICAL &amp; PLUBING</u></font></div><div><ul style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; color: rgb(83, 83, 83) !important;\"><li><font size=\"3\">Electrical &amp; Plumbing provisions for water heater, water purifier, washing machine casing capping wiring with modular switches.</font></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>', '[1,4,10,5,2,9,26]', NULL, NULL, 2, 'Vishrambag', 'Vishrambag, 100ft Road, sangli', NULL, NULL, '[\"/uploads/project-images/img_1789128687289_859183805.webp\",\"/uploads/project-images/img_1789128687291_127362599.jfif\",\"/uploads/project-images/img_1789128687293_205980994.jfif\",\"/uploads/project-images/img_1789128687436_679126230.jpg\",\"/uploads/project-images/img_1789128687455_475110278.jpg\"]', NULL, '', NULL, 2010000, 2415000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 5, '2026-09-11', '2026-09-20', 1, 0, 1, 1, '2026-09-11 12:03:52', NULL, '2026-09-12 07:38:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-12 07:38:24', '2026-11-05', 1, 3, '/uploads/project-brochures/brochure_1789128681398_66069491.pdf', '', 'https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3818.6053996431656!2d74.57694117492188!3d16.84592088395189!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3bc1186742ed525d%3A0x1108086bbd9bfe5e!2s100%20Feet%20Rd%2C%20Sangli%2C%20Sangli%20Miraj%20Kupwad%2C%20Maharashtra!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sin!4v1789128293086!5m2!1sen!2sin', 1, 1);
